SUMMARY:Ofgem scheduled energy price cap announcement (Jan–Mar 2027)
DESCRIPTION:Ofgem says it will announce the cap for 1 January–31 March 
 2027 by 25 November 2026. It may publish sooner. This is an announcement
  date\, not a payment or personal entitlement. Official source: https://
 www.ofgem.gov.uk/news/changes-energy-price-cap-between-1-october-and-31-
 december-2026
URL:https://www.ofgem.gov.uk/news/changes-energy-price-cap-between-1-octo
 ber-and-31-december-2026
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
