 ar.uk
DTSTAMP:20261117T090000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270226
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270227
SUMMARY:Warm Home Discount: deadline to contact helpline if more informat
 ion is required
DESCRIPTION:In England and Wales\, households asked to provide additional
  information for the 2026–27 Warm Home Discount must contact the schem
 e by 26 February 2027. Most eligible people receive the bill credit auto
 matically. This date is not a universal application deadline. Official s
 ource: https://www.gov.uk/the-warm-home-discount-scheme/if-you-live-in-e
 ngland-and-wales
URL:https://www.gov.uk/the-warm-home-discount-scheme/if-you-live-in-engla
 nd-and-wales
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
